	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z2"/>Te, reverende in Christo pater, non recte habere, dolet <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>mihi admodum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Scio ego te desiderare dissolvi et esse <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>cum Christo,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Phil 1, 23</ref></cit>.</note> quod certe multo longeque melius est, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>caeterum manere in carne magis necessarium propter <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nos et afflictam Christi ecclesiam.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Et certo scimus, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>quod mansurus sis in nostrum gaudium et profectum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>fidei.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Alioqui cum omnia sint perturbata adeoque <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>exulcerata, beatos illos merito praedicare possumus, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>qui in domino moriuntur.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tu vero, mi pater, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>cum non recte valeas, cur scribendi negotium non aliis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>das?</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Essent mihi filiorum tuorum, hominum mihi <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>amicissimorum literulae et ipsae gratissimae.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Tu illis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>summam quandam obiter et oretenus delineares; ipsi <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>postea scriptis suis omnia uberius prosequerentur.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Alio<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quin literas tuas exosculor et ut <foreign xml:lang="el">κειμήλια</foreign> repono; <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>sed nolui te negligere tamen valetudinem tuam.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Sed quibus te remuneror?</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Mirum est, quantum apud <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nos sit silentium; fratres nihil ex <placeName ref="l520">Valletelina</placeName> vel <lb xml:id="p1z20"/><placeName ref="l93">Clavenna</placeName> scribunt, procul dubio, quod de meo <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ad nostros reditu nondum illis constet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Venit <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>quidam ad nos ex <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName>, vir fide dignus, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>qui et ipse <placeName>Luggarno</placeName> propter evangelii confessionem <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>voluntarie exulat, qui affirmat se cum mercatoribus <lb xml:id="p1z25"/><placeName ref="l361">Norimbergae</placeName> audisse <persName>Philippum regem</persName> urgere pontificem, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ut ipse in propria persona (ut loquuntur) concilium <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>invisat; quod si facere detrectet, se quoque non <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>aditurum concilium, qui alioquin ipse interesse <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>cogitarit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Sunt deinde alii, qui nuntient <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> in regnum Neapolitanum incursionem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>fecisse et aliquot hominum millia abduxisse, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l1121">Genuenses</placeName> autem esse in maxima trepidatione; <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sed de hoc ultimo nihil affirmare possum; dicit <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>tamen dominus <persName>Philippus</persName> se in duobus locis audisse.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z35"/>Alii scribunt <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> circa <placeName>Sophy</placeName> occupatum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Der alt landtrichter von <placeName>Capol</placeName> kumpt yetz von <placeName ref="l93">Cläven</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>zeigt an, als er ußhar geritten, habe man im <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>hertzogthum <placeName ref="l306">Meyland</placeName> von guͦtem friden gesagt; <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>des zuͦ warzeichen laße man uß dem hertzogthumb <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l306">Meyland</placeName> den <placeName ref="l93">Clävneren</placeName> und <placeName ref="l520">Veltlineren</placeName> vyl <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>frucht zuͦkommen.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Sed ego cogito regem <persName>Philippum</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>ita velle delinire <placeName ref="l648">Rhetos</placeName>, scis quare.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ita nihil <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>certi scribere possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Uterque consul affirmat se plane <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>nihil ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> audire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Si quid habuero, non deero; interim <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>cupide expecto eventum huius conventus <placeName ref="l832">Gallici</placeName> ad <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>20. iulii indict; deus faxit, ut optata et laeta <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>audiamus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende in Christo pater, utque <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>diu valere possis, deus te ecclesię suae incolumem conservet.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Valeant et tui omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Nostri valent et te tuosque <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>salvere cupiunt.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 21. iulii anno domini 1561.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Tui observantissimus <persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>viro eruditione et pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> an<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>tistiti vigilantissimo, domino et pat<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>rono suo semper colendo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
